        " «هُوَ سَبُعٌ فَكُلُّ مَا أَدْخَلْتَ مِنَ اَلسَّبُعِ اَلْحَرَمَ أَسِيراً فَلَكَ أَنْ تُخْرِجَهُ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.2383 - Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as) was asked about a man who brought his cheetah into the sacred sanctuary (Al-Haram). Is he allowed to take it out?\nImam (as) replied: \"It is a predator. Whatever predator you bring into the sanctuary as a captive, you are allowed to take it out.\""
        ]
      }
